### 1. Test if the Server is Alive
GET http://localhost:8080/error

### 2. Pause a Milestone (Expecting 404 since database is empty)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/milestones/pause
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "milestoneId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "reason": "Waiting for client deliverables"
}

### 3. Submit a Magic-Link Review (Expecting 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/reviews/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "feedback": "The milestone is approved. Thank you."
}